Comment: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是没用的 Don't care about me baby
Comment: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I'm burning yeah
Comment: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:50.65,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重生后的Stage
Comment: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:53.03,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}We're gonna run this town tonight
Comment: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.45,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Let's get started
Comment: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Into the fire
Comment: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.38,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法夺走的Story
Comment: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:13.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就只是一人独自生存
Comment: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外出便是暴风雨Stormy
Comment: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.56,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Comment: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.68,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Like a King Kong
Comment: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:20.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Top 10的任务 完成后自己就是队长
Comment: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:21.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Can't stop
Comment: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:22.85,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Re:Monster
Comment: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:24.56,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从零开始的转生Big game
Comment: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.44,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赌下的钱财全部输光
Comment: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:27.40,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但I don't care
Comment: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:28.19,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}We got the dough
Comment: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:29.11,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hey Can you see me?
Comment: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:30.03,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好享受
Comment: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:31.74,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在街上将毛帽深深戴上
Comment: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:33.11,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不讨厌的Battle
Comment: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:34.82,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我天生报酬就是Double
Comment: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:36.83,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所吞下的Glory
Comment: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:38.62,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会就此成为我的血肉
Comment: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:41.58,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有意义 Set me free
Comment: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.08,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是没用的 Don't care about me baby
Comment: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:45.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I'm burning yeah
