Comment: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:51.17,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}We're gonna run this town tonight
Comment: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:52.59,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Let's get started
Comment: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:53.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Into the fire
Comment: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:54.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}You know Life's a game
Comment: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:56.55,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「绝对」只是Fake
Comment: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.43,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常识就是要Break
