Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.43,0:00:45.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.87,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.97,0:00:54.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.39,0:00:56.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁也不能改写我的故事
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.02,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}一路都是独自一人生存
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}外面是风暴席卷电闪雷鸣
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.03,0:01:16.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.62,0:01:17.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}就像金刚
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最难的十大任务 正好让我扬名立万统领天下
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我停不下来 怪物转生 从零转生 豪赌一把
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.58,0:01:26.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}每次下注我都倾家荡产
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.42,0:01:27.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}但我根本不在意
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.34,0:01:27.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.22,0:01:29.94,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.08,0:01:31.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}走在街上毛线帽戴好
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.87,0:01:32.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.28,0:01:36.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.88,0:01:38.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.70,0:01:41.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.13,0:01:45.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.97,0:01:48.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
